          %h2#applications Applications
          %h3#products_of_simplices Products of simplices
          %p
            Shuffles control the combinatorics of
            = succeed "s" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/product"} product
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/simplices"} simplices
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/products+of+simplices"} products of simplices
            for details.
          %h3#eilenbergzilber_map Eilenberg-Zilber map
          %p
            Related to the product of simplices: shuffles control the
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Eilenberg-Zilber+map"} Eilenberg-Zilber map
          %h3#differential_graded_coalgebras Differential graded coalgebras
          %p
            Shuffles are used in defining the pre-cgc structure on
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mo{:lspace => "thinmathspace", :rspace => "thinmathspace"} ⋀
                  %mi V
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \bigwedge V
            in the theory of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/differential+graded+coalgebras"} differential graded coalgebras
          %h3#differential_graded_hopf_algebras Differential graded Hopf algebras
          %p
            Shuffles are also used for defining the shuffle product on
            = succeed "," do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi T
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
